&lt;li&gt;Strong practical knowledge of IFRS and good understanding of local GAAP requirements; tax knowledge is beneficial but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Microsoft Excel skills and practical experience with ERP, reporting and consolidation tools such as Microsoft D365 and LucaNet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a global mindset and the ability to build international working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, accurate and proactive way of working, with the ability to deliver high-quality results in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and prioritise effectively during tight reporting deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in group accounting, consolidation or audit environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional qualification such as CPA, ACCA, ACA, IFRS Accountant, German “Bilanzbuchhalter” is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good written and verbal communication skills in English, combined with strong analytical and interpersonal skills (company language: English)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further languages (Romanian/German) are an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
